WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.067
Well, tensions

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:01.668
over the war

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:03.536
broke out at a meeting of Black

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:05.972
Sea nations earlier in Turkey.

00:00:06.439 --> 00:00:07.407
Have a look at this.

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:08.541
Russian delegates

00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.011
tore down the Ukrainian flag

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:12.879
and on the back of that,

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.482
Ukrainian delegate punched him

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:16.216
on social media.

00:00:16.216 --> 00:00:17.083
The Ukrainian

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:17.884
lawmaker wrote,

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:21.054
Paws off our flag, paws off Ukraine.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.123
And, well, some words

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.457
I'm not going to repeat here.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:25.792
Earlier, scuffles broke out

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:26.526
when Ukrainians

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:29.829
tried to shout over a Russian speaker

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:33.233
Are Russia and US relations is, quote,

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:36.603
on the verge of an open armed conflict.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.004
Yes.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.572
According to Russia's deputy

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:40.306
foreign minister,

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.776
as reported by the country's state media,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.110
at least, Sergei

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.512
Ryabkov accused

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.746
the US of being, quote,

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:50.150
a direct party to the Ukrainian conflict.

00:00:50.517 --> 00:00:51.451
But he qualified.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:52.118
What were these

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:52.952
ominous comments

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:53.820
saying that Moscow

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.521
is working

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:55.155
to make sure

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:57.457
an armed conflict with Washington

00:00:57.457 --> 00:00:58.892
doesn't happen

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:01.795
Let's find out what the US

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:02.829
is saying about this.

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:06.199
CNN's Oren Liebermann is at the Pentagon.

00:01:06.199 --> 00:01:08.435
What's been the U.S. response?

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.203
All right.
Well, this is the sort of statement

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:10.970
from Russia

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.938
and from the Kremlin

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:13.773
that fits into Russia's

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.008
narrative of the US

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:15.975
being part of the war

00:01:15.975 --> 00:01:17.243
in Ukraine, an accusation

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.345
Russia has repeatedly made, in fact,

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.480
with that drone explosion

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:20.947
we saw over

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.549
the Kremlin just several days ago,

00:01:22.549 --> 00:01:24.217
it was the Kremlin saying that Russia

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:25.952
that the US dictated

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:27.921
to Ukraine to carry out such an attack.

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.956
So this fits into that narrative.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:30.557
More importantly,

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:31.724
we have seen statements

00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:33.426
like this, hyperbolic statements

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:35.128
about how bad relations are

00:01:35.128 --> 00:01:36.062
from Russia before.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.063
In fact, several years ago,

00:01:37.063 --> 00:01:38.498
while I was reporting in Moscow,

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:40.333
Russia came out and said that relations

00:01:40.333 --> 00:01:41.401
between the U.S.

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:42.802
and Russia, between Washington

00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:44.170
and Moscow were the worst

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.004
they've ever been.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:45.472
Clearly,

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.107
we have seen them get far worse

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:49.209
in the last several years,

00:01:49.209 --> 00:01:50.577
especially the last several months.

00:01:50.577 --> 00:01:52.178
But it also fits into Russia's narrative

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.747
that Russia is the one trying to uphold

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.216
international law

00:01:56.216 --> 00:01:57.350
and justice throughout the world.

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:58.218
And it's the US

00:01:58.218 --> 00:02:00.019
that's the one that's endangering this.

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:01.387
So from Russia's perspective,

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.690
this neatly fits into their narrative

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:04.624
about how it's Russia

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.326
trying to uphold the global order

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.861
and the US threatening it.

00:02:07.861 --> 00:02:09.062
I haven't seen a response

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.964
specifically to this from the U.S.,

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:11.731
but the U.S.

00:02:11.731 --> 00:02:13.233
likely to point out in response

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.267
that it's Russia

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:15.969
that invaded Ukraine and Russia

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.103
that's threatening the order

00:02:17.103 --> 00:02:18.471
the world order that's been sustained

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:20.140
ever since pretty much the end of

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:21.007
of World War Two.

00:02:21.007 --> 00:02:22.142
So in this accusation

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.643
from Russia that the U.S.

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:25.044
and Russia are close

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:26.446
to armed conflict, again,

00:02:26.446 --> 00:02:27.580
you see the narrative

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:28.681
that Russia is trying

00:02:28.681 --> 00:02:29.649
to put out there, blaming

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:31.317
the US for the war in Ukraine,

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:32.485
blaming the U.S.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:33.686
for being involved in

00:02:33.686 --> 00:02:35.755
and a direct party to that war.

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.891
And Russia painting itself as the one

00:02:37.891 --> 00:02:39.759
trying to fix the global order and

00:02:39.759 --> 00:02:40.994
fix the situation

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:44.230
or Lehman's.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.698
That depends again for you folks.

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:46.666
Thank you.

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.001
Well, we're

00:02:48.001 --> 00:02:50.103
also seeing signs of deepening cracks

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:52.539
in Russia's war machine.

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:53.173
The head of

00:02:53.173 --> 00:02:55.308
what is the private military group

00:02:55.475 --> 00:02:58.444
evolved into issuing a stunning rebuke

00:02:58.444 --> 00:02:58.811
today,

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:01.381
a public rebuke against Vladimir

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:02.949
Putin's military

00:03:02.949 --> 00:03:04.851
He posted a grim video

00:03:04.851 --> 00:03:06.186
showing the bodies of fighters

00:03:06.186 --> 00:03:08.021
who he says died

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:08.888
because they are not

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:10.423
getting the ammunition

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:11.758
that they need to fight.

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:12.926
And we've got to warn you,

00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.627
although this clip is blurred,

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:17.797
its content is disturbing.

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:20.266
But that was quite an issue of

00:03:20.266 --> 00:03:21.801
these men here

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:24.871
who died today, or Wagner PMC.

00:03:25.305 --> 00:03:27.840
Their blood is still fresh

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.876
Film, all of them

00:03:30.743 --> 00:03:31.911
well ahead of Wagner,

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.680
also drawing a line in the sand,

00:03:33.680 --> 00:03:35.815
announcing that he will pull his forces

00:03:35.815 --> 00:03:37.717
out of parliament.

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:39.719
In Ukraine next week.

00:03:39.719 --> 00:03:40.920
Now, the Ukrainian military

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.121
is calling this

00:03:42.121 --> 00:03:44.057
a possible turning point in

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.024
what is that

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:47.327
brutal battle in eastern Ukraine.

00:03:47.994 --> 00:03:48.761
That battle, of course,

00:03:48.761 --> 00:03:50.296
has been raging for months,

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:51.998
producing heavy casualties

00:03:51.998 --> 00:03:54.867
with little progress for either side.

